flowchart TD
    INPUT["User Input / Property Change"] --> EV{"Edit Validate\n(Client)"}
    EV -->|Fail| ERR1["Show Inline Error"]
    EV -->|Pass| SERVER{"Validate Rule\n(Server on Commit)"}
    SERVER -->|Fail| ERR2["Block Save + Message"]
    SERVER -->|Pass| CONST{"Declare Constraint"}
    CONST -->|Fail| ERR3["Constraint Violation"]
    CONST -->|Pass| SAVE["Obj-Save to Database"]

    style SAVE fill:#e8f5e9
